2
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:23,600
ここがねぽらぼ学園！部活もクラスも違うけど、ねねたち同じ学寮生に住んでるんだ！
This is Nepolabo Academy! Even though our clubs and classes are different, we all live in the same student dormitory!

3
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:30,500
ふざけて、笑って、時々喧嘩して、でもあすまるとなんか落ち着く！
We fool around, laugh, and sometimes fight, but somehow being together is so comforting!

4
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:37,800
今日も談話室は賑やか。誰かの声が聞こえるだけで安心するんだよね。
The common room is lively today too. Just hearing someone's voice makes me feel at ease.

5
00:03:39,100 --> 00:03:44,800
この場所で私たちだけの学寮祭を作るなんて、楽しそうだしワクワクする！
Creating a dormitory festival just for us in a place like this sounds so fun and exciting!

6
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:58,800
さぁ、私たちの輝く青春が始まる！ねぽらぼ学園！！
Now, our brilliant youth begins! Nepolabo Academy!!

7
00:04:12,836 --> 00:04:18,916
今日は学寮祭！生徒会が中心になって開催する、夏の一大イベント！
Today is the dormitory festival! A massive summer event organized primarily by the student council!

8
00:04:19,036 --> 00:04:24,476
会長からの頼みで、急遽ねぽらぼで出し物を考えることになったんだけど――
At the student council president's request, Nepolabo was suddenly asked to come up with a festival booth idea, but—

9
00:04:25,096 --> 00:04:27,536
何も考えられてなーーい！！！
We haven't thought of a single thing AT ALL!!!

10
00:04:28,176 --> 00:04:32,416
やばいよ…気づいたら当日だよ〜〜！
This is bad... before we knew it, today's the day~!

11
00:04:33,276 --> 00:04:36,636
だから言ったじゃんもっと早く集まって決めようって！
That's why I told you we should've gotten together earlier to decide!

12
00:04:36,956 --> 00:04:41,456
いや〜なんとかなるって思ってたんだけどな〜(笑)
Well~ I figured things would somehow work out, you know~ (laughs)

13
00:04:42,176 --> 00:04:47,896
うぅ…これはマズい…変なことやったら、会長になんて言われるか……
Ugh... this is bad... If we do something weird, what on earth is the president going to say to us...

14
00:04:48,336 --> 00:04:49,776
(……)
(...)

15
00:04:50,816 --> 00:04:52,336
よしっ、断ろう！！
Alright, let's just turn it down!!

16
00:04:53,116 --> 00:04:56,516
やめなー！！当日に断れるわけないでしょ！
Stop that—!! There's no way we can turn it down on the day of the event!

17
00:04:56,896 --> 00:05:00,048
大丈夫大丈夫、ラミちゃんならきっと許してくれるって♪
It's fine, it's fine! Lamy-chan will surely forgive us♪

18
00:05:00,064 --> 00:05:01,064
大丈夫大丈夫、デミちゃんならきっと許してくれるって♪
It's totally fine, Demi-chan will definitely forgive us♪

19
00:05:01,264 --> 00:05:04,004
なんでラミィだけお咎め前提なのよっ！
Why am I the only one who's automatically in trouble?!

20
00:05:04,344 --> 00:05:06,204
……いや、まだ終わってない！！
...N-No, it's not over yet!!

21
00:05:06,404 --> 00:05:08,804
学寮祭はお昼から……
The dormitory festival starts at noon...

22
00:05:09,204 --> 00:05:11,804
ほんのちょっとだけ、まだ時間はある！
There's still a tiny, tiny bit of time left!

23
00:05:12,244 --> 00:05:14,704
よし、とりあえず案を出してみよっか。
Alright, let's brainstorm some ideas for now.

24
00:05:15,404 --> 00:05:25,584
学校の祭りといえば……焼きそば、じゃがバター、唐揚げ、クレープ、ポテト……
Speaking of school festivals... yakisoba, buttered potatoes, fried chicken, crepes, fries...

25
00:05:26,204 --> 00:05:27,844
食べ物しかないじゃん！！
That's just all food!!

26
00:05:28,244 --> 00:05:31,624
……でも今から仕込みはまあちょっと無理かもね。
...Though prepping all that from scratch right now might be kinda impossible.

27
00:05:32,224 --> 00:05:41,384
うん、まあできるとしたら炎天下でカラカラな喉にしみわたる……ラミィ水！これは売れるぜ～！
Yeah, well, if anything... Lamy Water! Dripping down dry throats under the blazing sun! This'll sell like hotcakes~

28
00:05:42,184 --> 00:05:43,024
やめろおおおお！！！
Cut it outtttt!!!

29
00:05:43,284 --> 00:05:46,484
うっひょおおお！しぼり出して～！
Woohoo! Squeeze it out~!

30
00:05:47,164 --> 00:05:50,644
バカなこと言ってないで！もっと真面目に考えなさいて！
Stop saying stupid things and take this more seriously!

31
00:05:51,184 --> 00:05:54,724
そんなに言うならラミィちゃんは何がいいの？
If you say so, what does Lamy-chan think we should do?

32
00:05:55,244 --> 00:06:00,004
ラミィ？そうだなぁ……やっぱり歌は歌いたいし……
Me? Well... I'd still want to sing...

33
00:06:00,204 --> 00:06:01,864
バンドとか、かな？
Maybe a band, or something?

34
00:06:03,064 --> 00:06:03,704
ふつう。
Basic.

35
00:06:04,184 --> 00:06:05,524
ひねりがな～い！
So unoriginal~!

36
00:06:06,184 --> 00:06:06,924
……プッ(笑)
......Pfft. (laughs)

37
00:06:07,164 --> 00:06:08,624
こいつら…！
You guys...!

38
00:06:09,164 --> 00:06:12,404
でもまあ、歌はいいかもね～。
But well, singing might be nice~.

39
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:17,464
ショート動画用にいろいろな曲練習してるし、その中から何かやってみる？
We've been practicing various songs for short videos, so wanna do something from those?

40
00:06:18,204 --> 00:06:22,644
あっじゃあねね、あれやりたい！！元気いっぱいの、ねねたちにピッタリなやつ！！
Ah, then Nene wants to do that one!! The super energetic one that's perfect for us!!

41
00:06:23,164 --> 00:06:25,804
あーー！！あれね！！
Aahh!! That one!!

42
00:06:26,164 --> 00:06:27,364
いいんじゃない！
Sounds good!

43
00:06:27,864 --> 00:06:29,924
じゃ、とりあえずやってみますか！
Well, let's give it a try for now!

44
00:06:31,104 --> 00:06:32,464
キメマスター！！
Kime Master!!

45
00:06:51,404 --> 00:06:54,064
前人未踏の秘境だとなあ そいやっ！
It's an uncharted frontier, you see! Soiya!

46
00:07:04,144 --> 00:07:08,404
生まれ変わる一歩目は 一歩目が大事さおそれないで
The first step of rebirth—the first step is important, don't be afraid!

47
00:07:08,804 --> 00:07:13,424
何度でも平気な顔で走り出して 行かなきゃ！上々の気負さ
Run out with a calm face no matter how many times! Gotta go! With top-notch spirit!

48
00:07:13,824 --> 00:07:18,624
やってみたいことには欲張りだね 欲張りごめんね 直さないよ
We're greedy for things we want to try—sorry for being greedy, I'm not fixing it!

49
00:07:19,004 --> 00:07:22,944
何度でも未来を書き換ええたくなるのさ 行かなきゃ！最後の仲間と
We want to rewrite the future over and over again! Gotta go! With our final friends!

50
00:07:23,324 --> 00:07:29,404
星になろうよ輝きたいよ 今は今だけ後悔しないようにね さあおいでおいで MONSTERS
Let's become stars, let's shine! Just for right now, so we don't have regrets—come on over, MONSTERS!

51
00:07:30,204 --> 00:07:33,344
暴れちゃおMONSTERS こんなにも無敵 PIKA STARS!
Let's go wild, MONSTERS! We're so invincible, PIKA STARS!

52
00:07:33,764 --> 00:07:36,984
夢がKIRA-KIRA 無駄にKIRA-KIRA 前進だ DOKA-DOKA わっ！
Dreams are sparkling, uselessly sparkling! Advancing with a bang, whoa!

53
00:07:37,424 --> 00:07:39,204
決まっちゃってる！
It's totally set!

54
00:07:39,824 --> 00:07:44,384
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限は無視だよ なんでもかんでもやっぱりが一番がいいよね
Full speed mode, heave-ho! Ignoring all limits! No matter what, giving it our all is definitely best!

55
00:07:44,804 --> 00:07:49,324
笑顔終わり最強BIG BANG 狙っちゃえ未来！ チェスト！
Smiles ending, ultimate BIG BANG—aim for the future! Chest!

56
00:07:49,884 --> 00:07:54,664
手と手りあたるから怖くないよね 夢の計測メーターは振り切れそうだよ
Touching hands means we aren't scared anymore! The dream's measurement meter is about to max out!

57
00:07:55,264 --> 00:08:04,524
地球からやってきたボクらは 本日も Go ahead! 怒られても止まれないのです 騒々しくてもごめんなさーい！
We came from Earth, today too, Go ahead! Even if we get scolded, we can't stop—sorry for being so noisy!

58
00:08:04,964 --> 00:08:09,384
先陣誰だい？ボクらだい！いわゆる前人未踏の秘境だとなあ そいやっ！
Who's taking the lead? We are! It's what you call an uncharted frontier, soiya!

59
00:08:20,024 --> 00:08:24,764
譲らないないない100歩目も 百歩譲るなんて負けだよ駄目だよ
We won't yield even a single step! Yielding a hundred steps means losing, no way!

60
00:08:25,024 --> 00:08:29,664
ゴールへのロードはジャリと岩だらけで 泣いても顔はに・や・り
The road to the goal is full of gravel and rocks, but even when crying, our faces are grinning!

61
00:08:30,024 --> 00:08:37,504
そんな時あきらめ悪く進め だってほらあきらめたくない夢が 進化してみんないて果ての果ての空へ
At times like that, press forward stubbornly! Because look, there are dreams we don't want to give up on, evolving together towards the edge of the sky!

62
00:08:37,824 --> 00:08:39,904
連れ去るボクら地球女子
We earth girls are taking you away!

63
00:08:39,904 --> 00:08:43,844
憧れたんだ星の光は消えないときめき
We longed for it, starlight is an unfading excitement!

64
00:08:44,304 --> 00:08:48,924
心拍数上がりまくり暴れちゃお MONSTERS 痛快で不敵 PIKA STARS!
Heart rate skyrocketing, let's go wild MONSTERS, thrilling and fearless PIKA STARS!

65
00:08:49,324 --> 00:08:52,344
瞬きらめき上昇中 つまり好調中
Blinking sparkle rising, meaning we're in top form!

66
00:08:52,524 --> 00:08:54,724
多分勝利は、キマっちゃってる！
Victory is probably already secured!

67
00:08:54,964 --> 00:09:00,004
バンドじゃないからせせっせっかっこつけなければ バンドじゃないからよいよいよいかっこがつくものだよ
It's not a band, so if we don't put on airs... It's not a band, so it actually looks cool!

68
00:09:00,404 --> 00:09:04,844
ばか騒ぎやんちゃ騒ぎやったもん勝ち狙っちゃえ未来！ チェスト！
Foolish ruckus, mischievous ruckus, winners take all—aim for the future! Chest!

69
00:09:05,204 --> 00:09:10,024
銀河のどっかの頂点に旗を立てるまで ニューなレコードの更新は続くんだってば
Until we plant our flag at the peak somewhere in the galaxy, breaking new records will just keep going!

70
00:09:10,424 --> 00:09:13,484
地球からやってきたボクらよやりまくれ Go ahead!
Us coming from Earth, go wild, Go ahead!

71
00:09:14,424 --> 00:09:18,224
さあ次の星へ！
Now, to the next star!

72
00:09:23,004 --> 00:09:27,464
一歩が百歩の始まりだから行こうよすぐに行こうよ
A single step is the beginning of a hundred steps, so let's go, let's go right now!

73
00:09:27,804 --> 00:09:32,464
無理は道理よりも強引だから瞬間をキミと一緒にね
Forcing things is bolder than reason, so let's share this moment together with you!

74
00:09:33,384 --> 00:09:37,944
真っ暗な空かもしれないけど僕らは輝きたい お目々を開いてお目々を離すなよー？
The sky might be pitch black, but we want to shine—open your eyes, don't look away, okay?

75
00:09:38,304 --> 00:09:44,524
モンスター！モンスター！モンスター！前人未踏の宇宙に全速の全力でGOだYeah！！
Monster! Monster! Monster! Into the uncharted universe at full speed and full power, GO yeah!!

76
00:09:49,824 --> 00:10:00,071
楽観だいそうだどうだっ
Optimism is right, isn't it?!

77
00:10:00,066 --> 00:10:03,516
そうだ そうだっ 地球はブルーだ ブルーだ
That's right, that's right! The Earth is blue, so blue!

78
00:10:03,976 --> 00:10:08,596
全部を欲しがれ EARTH女子！
Want it all, EARTH girls!

79
00:10:08,996 --> 00:10:13,456
天の川 そうかもそうかも 宇宙のスターにスターに
The Milky Way, maybe so, maybe so! Become stars of the universe!

80
00:10:13,936 --> 00:10:15,956
なりたい！ なりたい！
I want to be! I want to be!

81
00:10:16,176 --> 00:10:22,406
なれそう？なれそうだよ！なれそう？なれそうだよ！
Can we? Yes, we can! Can we? Yes, we can!

82
00:10:23,026 --> 00:10:24,106
キマっちゃったしね！
We totally nailed it!

83
00:10:24,106 --> 00:10:28,766
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限は無視だよ なんでもかんでもやっぱぱ全力がいいよね
Full speed mode, yo-heave-ho, ignoring all limits! Whatever it takes, giving it our all is the best, right?

84
00:10:28,966 --> 00:10:30,956
笑顔あり、秘密あり！
Smiles and secrets too!

85
00:10:31,096 --> 00:10:33,746
最強BIG BANG狙っちゃえ未来！
Aiming for the ultimate BIG BANG future!

86
00:10:33,746 --> 00:10:34,276
チェストー！
Chest!

87
00:10:34,276 --> 00:10:38,926
手と取り合ったらんたた 怖くないよね 夢の計測メーターは振り切れそうだよ
Holding hands and marching on, there's nothing to be afraid of! Our dream meter is about to max out!

88
00:10:39,136 --> 00:10:42,526
地球からやってきたボクらは 本日も Go ahead! Go ahead!
We came from Earth, and today we're going ahead! Going ahead!

89
00:10:42,896 --> 00:10:47,806
怒られるまで…怒られても止まれないのです
Until we get scolded... even if we get scolded, we can't stop!

90
00:10:47,956 --> 00:10:49,026
最後の最後もごめんなさーーい！
And sorry right till the very end!

91
00:10:49,146 --> 00:10:53,626
前人未到だ！ボクらだ！いわゆる前人未どの未踏地だよなぁ
Unprecedented! It's us! Truly uncharted territory!

92
00:10:53,966 --> 00:10:59,856
大いなる一歩さ ボクらと最高で前人未どの未踏地へGo!! そいやー！
A giant step! Head to the ultimate, unprecedented uncharted territory with us, Go!! Soiya!

93
00:11:15,197 --> 00:11:20,327
よーし、次はバンドだ！できる曲を片っぱしからやっていこう〜！！
Alright, next is a band! Let's power through all the songs we can play~!!

94
00:11:21,337 --> 00:11:24,517
おっ、でも私たち、楽器できなくない…？
Oh, but can we even play instruments...?

95
00:11:25,287 --> 00:11:31,767
いや、こういうのはね、雰囲気だ大事！頑張っている姿を見せれば、それでOK！
Nah, for this kind of thing, vibe is everything! If you show you're trying your best, that's totally OK!

96
00:11:33,177 --> 00:11:35,057
バカにしといて結局やるのね…
You make fun of it and end up doing it anyway...

97
00:11:35,507 --> 00:11:39,777
じゃあまず、誰が何やるか決めよ〜！ねねはギター！！
First, let's decide who does what~! Nene is on guitar!!

98
00:11:40,117 --> 00:11:41,897
じゃあししろんはドラムかな〜
Then Shishiron is on drums, I guess~

99
00:11:42,507 --> 00:11:44,357
ポルカは、あ、ベースで〜！
Polka is, ah, on bass~!

100
00:11:45,047 --> 00:11:48,397
じゃあラミィは…シンセ、やろうかなっ
Then Lamy will... do the synthesizer, I guess.

101
00:11:49,227 --> 00:11:51,717
そうしたら、演出も考えないとな〜
In that case, we need to think about stage production too~

102
00:11:52,037 --> 00:11:55,227
派手にドッカァーンってしたい！！
I want a flashy, massive explosion!!

103
00:11:55,827 --> 00:11:57,367
ざっくりだな〜
That's pretty vague~

104
00:11:58,097 --> 00:12:00,067
サビにキャノンとか出す？
Should we shoot out confetti cannons for the chorus?

105
00:12:00,297 --> 00:12:04,307
いいね！照明もレーザー出したりとかでピカピカにしてこっ！
Sounds good! Let's make it super flashy with lights and lasers too!

106
00:12:05,127 --> 00:12:08,597
まぁよし、じゃあねねはポルカと動き回ってパフォーマンスしよう！
Alright, then Nene and I will move around and perform together!

107
00:12:08,847 --> 00:12:11,147
やるやる任せてーー！！
You got it, leave it to meーー!!

108
00:12:12,377 --> 00:12:16,917
だ、大丈夫かぁ？間に合わなくってアタフタするんじゃない？
A-Are you guys okay? Won't you end up scrambling because you're out of time?

109
00:12:18,177 --> 00:12:21,057
ま、それも私たちらしさってことで〜
Well, that's just part of our charm~

110
00:12:22,277 --> 00:12:24,477
そ、ノリでなんとかなるなる！
Right, we'll just wing it and it'll work out!

111
00:12:25,617 --> 00:12:29,377
あ、そうだ、バンド名、どうするの？
Oh right, what are we going to name the band?

112
00:12:30,037 --> 00:12:32,447
えっ！かっこいいやつがいいな〜
Eh! I want a cool name~

113
00:12:33,437 --> 00:12:37,067
え、じゃあ…「青春★ピチピチフルスロットル団！！」
Um, then... "Youth ★ Pipi-Pipi Full Throttle Squad!!"

114
00:12:37,407 --> 00:12:38,857
だ、だっさ！？！？
T-That's so lame!?!?i

115
00:12:39,777 --> 00:12:45,357
あー、もうちょい5期生要素も入れたいね。ラーメン、炙り様、低気圧……
Ah, I want to add a bit more 5th Gen flavor. Ramen, Aburi-sama, low pressure......

116
00:12:46,357 --> 00:12:48,537
「カブトムシ」って入れたらかっこいいよ！
Adding "Rhinoceros Beetle" would make it cool!

117
00:12:49,227 --> 00:12:51,707
青春低気圧★ラーメンピチピチフルスロットルシバカリキダン！
Youth Low Pressure ★ Ramen Pipi-Pipi Full Throttle Lawn-Mowing Machine Squad!

118
00:12:52,307 --> 00:12:54,697
混ぜるな！ぐちゃぐちゃだよっ。
Don't mix them all together! It's a complete mess.

119
00:12:55,697 --> 00:12:57,167
じゃあラミィちゃん何がいいの？
Then what do you want, Lamy-chan?

120
00:12:58,147 --> 00:13:04,997
えーやっぱり可愛いのがいいかなぁ〜「ねぽらぼハーモニー♪」とかさ♪
Um, I'd prefer something cute~ Like "Nepolabo Harmony♪"~♪

121
00:13:06,207 --> 00:13:07,437
それでいいのかラミィ。
Are you really fine with that, Lamy?

122
00:13:07,747 --> 00:13:09,137
かっこよくないよ、ラミィ。
It's not cool at all, Lamy.

123
00:13:09,977 --> 00:13:11,477
俺、恥ずかしいよラミィ。
I'd be embarrassed, Lamy.

124
00:13:12,187 --> 00:13:14,677
ほんとに…お前らっ！！
Seriously... you guys!!

125
00:13:15,547 --> 00:13:18,937
よーーし！バンド名も決まったし、やってみますかーー！！
Alright! The band name is decided, let's give it a tryーー!!

126
00:13:19,487 --> 00:13:23,537
よーし、これで学寮祭の注目はいただきだーー！！
Alright, with this, all eyes at the dorm festival are oursーー!!

127
00:13:24,107 --> 00:13:25,687
えっ！？あれでいくの！？
Eh!? We're going with THAT name!?

128
00:13:26,177 --> 00:13:29,137
いくぞーー！！よーーい！！どんっ！！
Let's goーー!! Readyーー!! Go!!

129
00:13:57,517 --> 00:14:02,837
走って走って 憧れを越えて
Running, running, crossing beyond our dreams!

130
00:14:03,977 --> 00:14:09,457
Ready!! Steady!! Derby!!

131
00:14:14,247 --> 00:14:19,847
まだ見たことのないスピードの向こう側へ
Toward the other side of a speed we've never seen before!

132
00:14:20,127 --> 00:14:21,327
ワームアップは完璧さ！
Our warm-up is complete!

133
00:14:21,327 --> 00:14:24,517
地球をほら 踏み込む踏み鉄
Look at us stepping onto Earth and pressing down the pedal!

134
00:14:24,997 --> 00:14:27,137
ゴール前のキセキ
The miracle right before the finish line!

135
00:14:27,297 --> 00:14:30,147
仕掛ける場所は最終コーナー
The place to make our move is the final corner!

136
00:14:30,847 --> 00:14:35,357
あとは 行けるところまで息をきらしてさ
After that, we'll run out of breath until we reach as far as we can!

137
00:14:35,827 --> 00:14:40,427
何万回と手を叩くオーディエンス 割れんばかり響く大歓声
The audience clapping thousands of times, the deafening roar of loud cheers!

138
00:14:40,937 --> 00:14:45,057
ファンファーレが鳴る 心音が高まる
A fanfare rings out, our heartbeats rise!

139
00:14:45,057 --> 00:14:49,227
動き出す秒針 夢のゲートが開く
The second hand starts moving, the gate of dreams opens!

140
00:14:50,067 --> 00:14:55,637
走って走って 憧れを追い越して
Running, running, overtaking our dreams!

141
00:14:56,027 --> 00:14:57,677
次は誰の番だ！？
Whose turn is it next!?

142
00:14:58,287 --> 00:14:59,857
冷めないスーパースター
An uncooling superstar!

143
00:15:00,487 --> 00:15:02,577
さあ目指すはスーパースター
Now, aiming to be a superstar!

144
00:15:04,027 --> 00:15:07,487
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる勝負！
Leaving them in the dust and winning!

145
00:15:08,137 --> 00:15:10,107
そう、これは本能、走りたい！
That's right, it's instinct—I want to run!

146
00:15:11,317 --> 00:15:14,997
譲れない衝動、叫びたい！勝利の雄叫びよ
An unyielding impulse, I want to shout! A shout of victory—

147
00:15:16,367 --> 00:15:17,917
轟け！
Resound!

148
00:15:22,757 --> 00:15:28,237
誰かとバチバチ競うことでしか到達し得ない輝くゴールライン
The shining finish line that can only be reached by fiercely competing with someone!

149
00:15:29,207 --> 00:15:32,867
ああどんな理屈でも言語化できない感情
Ah, emotions that no amount of logic can put into words!

150
00:15:33,317 --> 00:15:39,177
科学を超えて、格闘を超えて、熱い勝負したい！したい！どちらが最強か
Transcending science, transcending combat, I want a passionate showdown! I want it! Who is the strongest?

151
00:15:40,157 --> 00:15:47,457
決めようか好敵手！速い者が勝つ、何も言い訳はなしだ
Let's decide, rival! The fast one wins, no excuses allowed!

152
00:15:48,037 --> 00:15:54,747
よーいどん！飛ばして飛ばして、涙さえ振り切って
Ready, set, go! Dash and dash, shaking off even tears!

153
00:15:55,307 --> 00:15:59,957
前に足を出すんだ、悩む暇なんてない！答えを出すのは
Step forward, there's no time to hesitate! Finding the answer—

154
00:16:02,397 --> 00:16:07,207
ゴールした後でも遅くない、恐え！
It's not too late even after crossing the finish line, dauntless!

155
00:16:07,527 --> 00:16:09,187
抗えぬ本能、絶対！
Uncontrollable instinct, absolutely!

156
00:16:10,097 --> 00:16:15,607
譲れない譲渡、騒ぎたい！王者の雄叫びに
Unyielding surrender, I want to make noise! To the champion's shout of victory—

157
00:16:16,337 --> 00:16:17,467
続け！
Follow!

158
00:16:17,467 --> 00:16:19,571
Ready! Steady! Derby!

159
00:16:46,057 --> 00:16:50,117
どんなことが起こったって、レースが止まらないように
No matter what happens, so that the race never stops—

160
00:16:50,987 --> 00:16:55,677
ずっと続いていくこの友情
This friendship that will go on forever!

161
00:16:56,357 --> 00:16:59,117
憎まれ口を叩いたって、みんな一列になれば
Even if we talk back, once we line up all together—

162
00:17:01,907 --> 00:17:06,207
AH てっぺんめがけて位置についてよーいどん！
AH, aiming for the top, take your marks, ready, set, go!

163
00:17:09,917 --> 00:17:15,587
走って走って走って走って、憧れを追い越して
Run and run, run and run, overtaking our aspirations!

164
00:17:17,887 --> 00:17:22,577
次は誰の番だ？さあ目指すはスーパースター
Whose turn is next? Now, aiming to be a superstar!

165
00:17:23,237 --> 00:17:25,117
生きていく意味なんて
The meaning of living—

166
00:17:25,247 --> 00:17:29,687
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる勝負！勝ちたい！
Is the victory that follows after leaving everyone in the dust! I want to win!

167
00:17:30,197 --> 00:17:32,217
そう、これは本能、走りたい！
That's right, it's instinct—I want to run!

168
00:17:33,037 --> 00:17:37,387
譲れない衝動、叫びたい！勝利の雄叫びよ
An unyielding impulse, I want to shout! A shout of victory—

169
00:17:38,367 --> 00:17:39,807
轟け！
Resound!

170
00:17:40,107 --> 00:17:42,571
Ready! Steady! Derby!

171
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:12,829
[Text: 雪花ラミィ]ひゃあぁぁぁっ!! 冷たぁい!!
[Text: Yukihana Lamy]Kyaaaaah!! It's so cold!!

172
00:18:13,059 --> 00:18:16,669
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]バンドして汗かいちゃったからね～ リフレッシュ、リフレッシュ♪
[Text: Shishiro Botan]We worked up a sweat playing in the band, after all~ Refresh, refresh♪

173
00:18:17,659 --> 00:18:20,649
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]ほら、おまるも早く進んでー!!
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]Come on, Omaru, hurry up and get in too—!!

174
00:18:21,129 --> 00:18:26,619
[Text: 尾丸ポルカ]あぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ!! 地獄シャワー、無理～～～～!!!
[Text: Omaru Polka]Aaaaaahhhhhh!! This hellish shower is impossible~~~~!!!

175
00:18:26,929 --> 00:18:31,989
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]シャワー浴びて、プールで泳いで遊んだら、きっといいアイディアも出てくるってば!
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]If we take a shower, swim in the pool, and play, I'm sure good ideas will come out!

176
00:18:32,189 --> 00:18:36,639
[Text: 雪花ラミィ]そう言って、毎回遊んで疲れて終わるんだけどね～～
[Text: Yukihana Lamy]You always say that, but every time we just play until we're exhausted and end it~~

177
00:18:37,209 --> 00:18:41,949
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]でもさ、夏といえばプールでしょ！ここで何かするのもアリじゃない？
[Text: Shishiro Botan]But hey, summer means the pool! Isn't doing something here a good idea too?

178
00:18:42,919 --> 00:18:47,459
[Text: 尾丸ポルカ]プールでできることといえば……撮影会!!
[Text: Omaru Polka]When it comes to things you can do at a pool...... a photo shoot!!

179
00:18:47,959 --> 00:18:50,389
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]ねねたちの水着姿で！
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]In our swimwear!

180
00:18:50,869 --> 00:18:53,759
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]お客さんを……悩殺♡
[Text: Shishiro Botan]Captivating the audience♡

181
00:18:54,159 --> 00:18:57,219
[Text: 雪花ラミィ]ダメに決まってるだろ!! 会長に怒られるよっ!!
[Text: Yukihana Lamy]That's obviously out of the question!! The student council president will chew us out!!

182
00:18:57,729 --> 00:19:00,399
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]絶対盛り上がるのにな～
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]Even though it would definitely hype everyone up~

183
00:19:00,829 --> 00:19:06,989
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]プールにラミィちゃん沈めて……産地直送ラミィ水！これは売れる!!
[Text: Shishiro Botan]Submerging Lamy-chan in the pool...... Farm-direct Lamy water! This'll sell!!

184
00:19:07,209 --> 00:19:11,529
[Text: 雪花ラミィ]そこっ!! ラミィから出汁とろうとするな！ラミィ水は忘れろ!!
[Text: Yukihana Lamy]Hey you!! Don't try to extract broth from Lamy! Forget about Lamy water!!

185
00:19:11,829 --> 00:19:16,109
[Text: 尾丸ポルカ]じゃあ、ライブしとく？プールサイドで！
[Text: Omaru Polka]Then, how about doing a live show? By the poolside!

186
00:19:16,399 --> 00:19:23,349
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]まぁ、そうなるよね～！でも夏、プール、歌……最高にマッチしてるっ！
[Text: Shishiro Botan]Well, of course it would come to that~! But summer, pools, and songs... match each other perfectly!

187
00:19:23,759 --> 00:19:30,419
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]いいねいいね！あの夏フェスの曲やろうよ～！水鉄砲とか持って、みんなでビショビショになりながらさ！
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]Awesome, awesome! Let's play that summer festival song~holding water guns and getting completely soaked together!

188
00:19:30,899 --> 00:19:35,059
[Text: 雪花ラミィ]え？でもあれってエモい感じの恋愛ソングじゃなかった……？
[Text: Yukihana Lamy]Eh? But wasn't that song a sentimental love song...?

189
00:19:35,929 --> 00:19:39,369
[Text: 尾丸ポルカ]それをわたしたちなりに歌い上げるってことよ！
[Text: Omaru Polka]That means we sing it out in our own way!

190
00:19:39,849 --> 00:19:42,589
[Text: 獅白ぼたん]フェスにぴったりの選曲だからね！
[Text: Shishiro Botan]It's the perfect song choice for a festival!

191
00:19:42,939 --> 00:19:47,149
[Text: 桃鈴ねね]それじゃあ…終わらない夏にするぞーーっ!!!
[Text: Momosuzu Nene]Alright then... let's make this an endless summer~~~!!!

192
00:19:47,459 --> 00:19:49,519
[Text: 全員]おーー!!!!
[Text: All]Oooooh!!!!

193
00:20:15,196 --> 00:20:19,496
まだ照れくさいあいつとフェスに
Going to the festival with you, still so shy...

194
00:20:19,796 --> 00:20:25,196
行く約束をしたはいいけど
We made plans to go, but...

195
00:20:25,496 --> 00:20:29,896
あまりノってたら引かれそう
If I get too into it, you might think it's weird...

196
00:20:30,196 --> 00:20:35,496
控えめに楽しむって決めたんだ
So I decided to keep it low-key and just have fun.

197
00:20:36,146 --> 00:20:46,846
でも私の大好きな ロックスター真夏のステージで
But on the midsummer stage for my favorite rockstar...

198
00:20:47,096 --> 00:20:52,496
スーツを着たロックスターもう
The rockstar in a suit...

199
00:20:53,596 --> 00:20:57,496
我慢できない！
I can't hold it back anymore!

200
00:20:57,796 --> 00:21:02,196
止まらないのは私の汗 それとも君への気持ち？
Is it my sweat that won't stop, or my feelings for you?

201
00:21:03,196 --> 00:21:08,496
溢れ落ちてく恋心
My overflowing feelings of love...

202
00:21:09,096 --> 00:21:14,496
こぼれないようにすくってね 止まらないのは夏への期待
Scoop them up so they don't spill; my excitement for summer won't stop!

203
00:21:16,096 --> 00:21:21,096
忘れられない夏になるかも
This might become an unforgettable summer...

204
00:21:30,096 --> 00:21:35,096
夏の日差しで焼け焦げそう
I feel like I'm scorching in the summer sun...

205
00:21:35,596 --> 00:21:40,496
すべてがスローモーションになる
Everything turns into slow motion.

206
00:21:41,096 --> 00:21:46,096
他人の汗もどうでもよくて
I don't care about anyone else's sweat at all.

207
00:21:46,296 --> 00:21:51,496
日差しの鬱陶しさも感じない
I don't even feel the annoyance of the sunlight.

208
00:21:51,996 --> 00:21:59,796
でも私の大好きなロックスター
But my favorite rockstar...

209
00:22:00,096 --> 00:22:07,796
ラストの曲終わりロックスター帰ってく
When the last song ends, the rockstar heads back.

210
00:22:08,096 --> 00:22:14,496
ライブが終わって私に帰ってそれから…
The live show ends, you come back to me, and then...

211
00:22:34,996 --> 00:22:40,196
ずいぶん前のほうに来ちゃったみたい
It looks like we've come pretty far forward.

212
00:22:40,796 --> 00:22:45,996
さっきまで二人がいた場所、もう違う景色
The place where we were just now is a completely different scenery.

213
00:22:46,296 --> 00:22:50,096
ああ、私しちゃった本気だったのに
Ah, I did it, even though I was being serious...

214
00:22:51,096 --> 00:22:55,996
うつむく私の隣に君が
You are right beside my downcast self.

215
00:22:56,996 --> 00:23:01,996
私の目を見つめる君時間が止まってるみたい
You gaze into my eyes, as if time has stopped.

216
00:23:02,796 --> 00:23:08,496
少し笑って君は言う
Smiling a little, you say...

217
00:23:09,096 --> 00:23:14,196
新しい君が見れたから今日は本当に来てよかった
I'm so glad I came today, because I got to see a new side of you.

218
00:23:14,996 --> 00:23:19,496
照れ笑いの奥見えちゃそうで
It feels like my shy smile might show right through...

219
00:23:19,796 --> 00:23:25,196
私は焦って目をそらした 止まらないのは二人の恋だ
I panicked and looked away; our love is unstoppable.

220
00:23:26,496 --> 00:23:31,996
今年の夏よ終わらないでよ
Don't end yet, this summer of ours!

221
00:24:03,165 --> 00:24:06,565
はあ～～～～……泣いた泣いたっ♪
Haah... I cried and cried!

222
00:24:07,085 --> 00:24:12,385
もう、くったくた…で、結局な～んも決まってないっていう(笑)
Man, I'm totally exhausted... And in the end, we still haven't decided anything at all.

223
00:24:13,165 --> 00:24:18,565
制服、洗濯に出しちゃったし……今日の衣装、いつもの着替えしかないよ～
I sent my uniform to the laundry... So today we only have our usual spare outfits~

224
00:24:19,085 --> 00:24:22,585
もうこのままの格好で何かやるしかないね～っ！
Guess we have no choice but to do something in these outfits!

225
00:24:23,165 --> 00:24:33,485
でもさ、やっぱりわたしたちにできることって…歌とダンス、かな～って思うんだよね～
But you know, I really think what we can do best is... singing and dancing.

226
00:24:34,085 --> 00:24:38,985
うん。変に気飾らずに、“いつものわたしたち”を見せるのが一番かも
Yeah. Instead of trying too hard to dress up, showing our usual selves is probably best.

227
00:24:39,285 --> 00:24:46,485
よっし！じゃあ歌う曲決めよう！！ねねは……エモい感じがいいなっ！いつものと違う感じの！
Alright! Let's decide on the song to sing! Nene wants something emotional! Something a bit different from usual!

228
00:24:47,085 --> 00:24:50,485
ポルカはさ～、恋愛ソングやってみたいな～っ
And Polka wants to try doing a romance song~

229
00:24:51,085 --> 00:24:54,985
ラミィは元気いっぱい！合いの手たっぷりな盛り上がるやつ！！
Lamy wants something super energetic with lots of call-and-response hypes!!

230
00:24:55,285 --> 00:24:59,985
歌詞がグッと心にくる系の曲もいいな～
A song with lyrics that really strike the heart would be nice too~

231
00:25:00,414 --> 00:25:01,914
(……)
(...)

232
00:25:02,258 --> 00:25:05,998
まぁ、みんな趣味がバラバラだしね～
Well, everyone has different hobbies, right~

233
00:25:06,198 --> 00:25:08,618
でも全部は無理じゃない？
But doing all of them is impossible, right?

234
00:25:09,208 --> 00:25:12,448
いや、できる！！やってみなきゃ始まらないっ！
No, we can do it!! We won't start unless we try!

235
00:25:13,208 --> 00:25:14,748
まさか…全部やる気？
You don't mean... doing all of them?

236
00:25:15,268 --> 00:25:20,548
もちろん！どれか1つなんて勿体ないでしょ！全部やって、良いのがあるのか考えよう！
Of course! It's a waste to pick just one! Let's do all of them and see which one is best!

237
00:25:21,148 --> 00:25:23,868
ちょっとは休憩入れさせてね…
Let me take a little break...

238
00:25:24,588 --> 00:25:29,508
だったらさ！各々自分の部屋でやりたい曲をやっていこっ！
In that case! Let's each do the song we want in our own rooms!

239
00:25:30,438 --> 00:25:35,438
じゃあまずねねからねっ！この曲は～ねねは違う服でやる！
Then first is Nene! This song—Nene will do it in a different outfit!

240
00:25:36,198 --> 00:25:37,588
わかった！やろっか。
Understood! Let's do it.

241
00:25:38,168 --> 00:25:41,768
今度こそ、これで出物を決めるぞ～！
This time for sure, we'll decide our lineup with this~!

242
00:25:42,278 --> 00:25:45,438
じゃあやりますか！ねね、着替え終わった？
Shall we do it then? Nene, are you done changing?

243
00:25:46,158 --> 00:25:51,458
オッケー！それじゃあ、いきま～す！！
Okay! Here we go!!

244
00:26:08,776 --> 00:26:13,696
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've already forgotten

245
00:26:13,696 --> 00:26:18,516
夏の木陰に座ったまま
Sitting under the shade of a summer tree

246
00:26:18,516 --> 00:26:24,376
アイスを口に放り込んで風を待っていた
Popping ice cream into my mouth and waiting for the breeze

247
00:26:24,376 --> 00:26:29,566
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've already forgotten

248
00:26:29,566 --> 00:26:33,496
世の中の全部嘘だらけ
How the world is full of lies

249
00:26:33,496 --> 00:26:39,206
本当の価値を二人で探しに行こうと笑ったこと
And how we laughed about going to find true value together

250
00:26:39,206 --> 00:26:44,686
忘れないように 色褪せないように
So we won't forget, so it won't fade away

251
00:26:44,686 --> 00:26:50,136
形に残るものが全てじゃないように
So that physical things aren't everything that remains

252
00:26:50,136 --> 00:26:57,286
言葉をもっと教えて 夏が来るって教えて
Teach me more words, tell me that summer is coming

253
00:26:57,286 --> 00:27:02,806
僕は描いてる 瞳に映ったのは夏の亡霊だ
I am painting it—what was reflected in my eyes was a summer phantom

254
00:27:02,806 --> 00:27:09,206
風にスカートが揺れて 思い出なんて忘れて
My skirt swaying in the breeze, forgetting even memories

255
00:27:09,206 --> 00:27:16,236
浅い呼吸をする 汗を拭って夏めく
Breathing shallowly, wiping away sweat as summer deepens

256
00:27:29,927 --> 00:27:35,437
もう忘れてしまったかな
I wonder if you've already forgotten

257
00:27:35,437 --> 00:27:40,497
夏の木陰に座った頃
The time we sat under the shade of a summer tree

258
00:27:40,497 --> 00:27:45,487
遠くの丘から顔出した雲があったじゃないか
Wasn't there a cloud poking its head out from a distant hill?

259
00:27:45,487 --> 00:27:51,437
君はそれを掴もうとして 馬鹿みたいに空を切った手で
You tried to grab it, cutting through the sky like a fool with your hand

260
00:27:51,437 --> 00:27:57,357
僕は紙に雲一つを書いて 笑って握って見せて
While I drew a single cloud on paper, laughing and showing it clenched in my fist

261
00:27:57,357 --> 00:28:04,697
忘れないように 色褪せないように 歴史に残るものが全てじゃないから
So we won't forget, so it won't fade away, because things left in history aren't everything

262
00:28:05,197 --> 00:28:15,627
今だけ顔も失くして 言葉も全部忘れて 君は笑ってる 夏を待っている 僕ら亡霊だ
Losing even our faces just for now, forgetting all words, you are smiling, we are summer phantoms waiting for summer

263
00:28:15,627 --> 00:28:25,197
心をもっと教えて 夏の匂いを教えて 浅い呼吸をする
Teach me more of your heart, teach me the scent of summer, breathing shallowly

264
00:28:53,738 --> 00:28:59,128
忘れないように 色褪せないように
So we won't forget, so it won't fade away

265
00:28:59,128 --> 00:29:04,888
心に響くものが全てじゃないから
Because things that resonate in the heart aren't everything

266
00:29:08,608 --> 00:29:19,258
言葉をもっと教えて さよならだって教えて 今も見るんだよ 夏に咲いている花に亡霊を
Teach me more words, tell me goodbye, even now I see the summer phantom in the flowers blooming in summer

267
00:29:19,258 --> 00:29:26,638
言葉じゃなくて時間を 時間じゃなくて心を
Not words, but time; not time, but the heart

268
00:29:26,638 --> 00:29:33,058
浅い呼吸をする 汗を拭って夏めく
Breathing shallowly, wiping away sweat as summer deepens

269
00:29:35,908 --> 00:29:49,298
夏の匂いがする
I smell summer

270
00:29:55,368 --> 00:30:00,163
もう忘れてしまったかな 夏の木陰に座ったまま
I wonder if you've already forgotten, sitting under the shade of a summer tree

271
00:30:57,264 --> 00:31:03,424
土曜日は 会えることが 当たり前になって
Saturdays meeting up became a given,

272
00:31:04,184 --> 00:31:11,044
不安からの あの気持ちが 消えてちょっと寂しいの
and that feeling of anxiety is gone, leaving me a bit lonely.

273
00:31:12,024 --> 00:31:17,764
一生分のキスの回数 すぐに超えちゃうよ まだ少し まだもっと
We'll easily surpass a lifetime's worth of kisses—still a bit more, still even more,

274
00:31:21,964 --> 00:31:26,404
特別でいたい ずっと
I want to be special to you forever.

275
