出会ってから付き合うまでの あの感じでいよ
Let's keep that feeling from when we first met until we started dating.

276
00:31:33,224 --> 00:31:40,164
わかってる ふりなんて 100年後もいらない
I don't need to pretend I understand, not even 100 years from now.

277
