わかってる ふりなんて 100年後もいらない
I don't need to pretend I understand, not even 100 years from now.

289
00:33:41,865 --> 00:33:47,125
二人の合図が増えたって 大事なこと言おう
Even if our secret signals increase, let's say what's important.

290
00:33:47,885 --> 00:33:57,245
夏の日のはじまりを 季節が変わっても覚えてて
Remember the start of that summer day, even if the seasons change.

