327
00:40:45,062 --> 00:40:51,612
Ah 会えない理由はわかってるのに
Ah, even though I know why we can't meet...

328
00:40:52,072 --> 00:40:58,442
物語の鍵を握って遊んでいるのは誰
Who is holding the key to this story and playing around?

329
