ずいぶん悪趣味な暇潰し
Such a rather bad-taste pastime.

330
00:41:05,832 --> 00:41:12,512
その心の奥を掴んで揺さぶるものは何
What is it that grabs and shakes the depths of this heart?

331
00:41:13,342 --> 00:41:18,912
考えてるだけで日が暮れる
Just thinking about it makes the day end.

332
00:41:20,072 --> 00:41:26,642
苦しくて切なくて楽しいて日が暮れる
Painful, heartbreaking, yet fun as the day fades away.

333
00:41:27,512 --> 00:41:35,092
